<title>USA: Houston Industries names president.</title>
<headline>Houston Industries names president.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Houston Industries Inc said on Wednesday that R. Steve Letbetter, the president and chief operating officer of its Houston Lighting &amp; Power unit since 1993, has been elected president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Don Sykora retired as president and chief operating officer a year ago and chairman and chief executive officer Don Jordan reassumed the title of president after Sykora's retirement, the company said.</p>
<p>Jordan will continue as chairman and chief executive for two more years, the company said.</p>
</text>
